Step 1: Open the Gem Creator
On your desktop, open Gemini.

In the left-hand sidebar, click on Gem Manager (or click Gems if it's already visible).

Click New Gem.

Step 2: Configure the Gem Settings
You will see two main text fields: Name and Instructions. Fill them out using the template below.

Name:
Code Evaluator & Grader

Instructions:
Copy and paste the system prompt below directly into the Instructions box. This defines exactly how the Gem will behave and ensures consistent grading.

Step 3: Save and Use Your Gem
Click Create (or Save) in the top right corner.

Your new Gem will now appear in your left sidebar under the "Gems" section.
